    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Members:

  OddCrossings : the surface is crossed an odd number of times on the way from the voxel to infinity, triangle orientation is ignored:
enclosed cavities stay empty, nested layers alternate inside and outside, and overlapping parts of a self-intersecting surface cancel each other

  PositiveWinding : the winding number of the surface around the voxel is positive (for a mesh with outward normals):
overlapping parts of a self-intersecting surface are united, a cavity stays empty if its triangles look inside it
</verbatim> </para>
